Sval: The Home pane registers its own home page settings

The settings of what new windows and new tabs show, and the custom home
page subpane, were registered by the new tab add-on's AboutPreferences
when the Home pane loaded. Sval does not ship the add-on, so the pane's
module registers them, with the code as the add-on had it.

